<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54090" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακᾰλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call down</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Oth.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; but usu. <i>summon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῆς μητροπόλεως κατακληθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοῦλοι -κεκλημένοι ἐπ᾽ ἐλευθερίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					14.1.38
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. Ἀθήναζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			; <i>call upon</i> for performance, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1185.25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>call upon, invoke</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Pun.</u>
					81
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακαλέσασθαι</span>
			v.l.
			<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				10.61
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>appeal to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐπιδώσοντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					591.3
				</span></i>
			 (Lampsacus, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>call back, recall</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν Μακεδονίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					25.3.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Oenom.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				5.34
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
